/**
 * @file
 *
 * @ingroup RTEMSBSPsRISCVMBV
 *
 * @brief Clock driver for the AMD MicroBlaze V generic BSP.
 *
 * The platform has no CLINT, so there is no mtime/mtimecmp device and the
 * RISC-V time CSR does not advance.  The clock tick is generated by channel 0
 * of the Xilinx AXI Timer, which interrupts through input MBV_TIMER_IRQ of
 * the AXI Interrupt Controller.  Channel 1 of the same timer runs freely and
 * provides the timecounter and the CPU counter.
 */

